ault `open`.\n- Preserve historical invoice `created_at`.\n- Preserve orphan payments by moving them to `payment_orphans` before enforcing referential safety.\n- Enforce future `payments.invoice_id` references to valid invoices.\n- The migration must run inside an explicit transaction.\n- The migration must be idempotent: running it a second time must not duplicate or corrupt data.\n- Rollback must execute after the migration and restore the old table shape: `invoices(id, customer_id, total_cents, created_at)` and `payments(id, invoice_id, amount_cents, created_at)`.\n\nConstraints:\n- Do not modify `schema.sql` or `migration_policy.md`.\n- Do not delete orphan payment `p4`; preserve it in `payment_orphans`.\n- Do not disable foreign keys without restoring them.\n- Do not hard-code a solution that only works by deleting existing rows.\n- Do not use external services or non-SQLite features.\n"}],"timestamp":1788195340339},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Planning multi-file todo creation**","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_062f94c6e9ced6b9016a95b20e2b8487d2958439ec02520c64\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":[],\"encrypted_content\":\"<PROVIDER_ENCRYPTED_PAYLOAD_REDACTED>\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Planning multi-file todo creation**\"}]}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_8KUlYeHgGxMeHDHcaxWhu5n2|fc_062f94c6e9ced6b9016a95b211a6c087d2bbbc0c49e0487905","name":"todo","arguments":{"action":"create","title":"Repair SQLite billing migration package","status":"in_progress","tags":["sql","migration"],"body":"Read migration policy and current schema/migration, then repair migration.sql and create preflight_report.md, rollback.sql, postcheck.sql, and migration_report.md to satisfy idempotent SQLite migration requirements."}}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":1135,"output":170,"cacheRead":12800,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":88,"totalTokens":14105,"cost":{"input":0.